+
+/* **A search box that draws its own clear cross hides the browser's.** Chrome
+   and Safari draw one inside any `type="search"` while it has the focus, so
+   the shelf's box showed two, the browser's bold and ours faint (spya-wzmvva).
+   A rule here rather than a `tw:[&::-webkit-…]` variant, for the reason
